---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="pepprime | Shipping Policy" description="Shipping policy for pepprime website.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6 sm:py-16 prose-policy">
    <div class="label-pill">Policy</div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4">Effective date: [Insert date]</p>
    <p>pepprime provides direct communication for shipping discussion and order coordination.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Processing</h2>
    <p>Processing time depends on product availability, order size, and destination requirements.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Delivery Time</h2>
    <p>Estimated delivery times are not guaranteed and may vary because of destination, customs clearance, courier operations, weather, or public holidays.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Customer Responsibility</h2>
    <p>Customers are responsible for providing accurate shipping details and for understanding their local import requirements and destination-specific restrictions.</p>
    <h2 class="mt-8 text-2xl font-semibold">Tracking</h2>
    <p>Where tracking is available, it will be shared after dispatch. Updates depend on the courier and route.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
